        <div class="container hero-content">
            <h1 class="hero-title">PUSH YOUR LIMITS<br>WITH SCIENTIFIC<br>ENDURANCE TESTING</h1>
            <p class="hero-subtitle">"Avoid injuries, overtraining and maximize your athletic potential through personalized lactate threshold and hydration testing services tailored to endurance athletes."</p>
            <div class="hero-author">— Jasmel Acosta</div>
            <a href="#pricing" class="btn-primary">Get Started</a>
        </div>
        <div class="scroll-indicator">
            <i class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Services Section -->
    <section id="services" class="services">
        <div class="container">
            <!-- Service 1: Lactate Threshold Test -->
            <div class="service-card">
                <div class="service-image">
                    <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1571902943202-507ec2618e8f?w=800" alt="Lactate Threshold Testing">
                </div>
                <div class="service-content">
                    <h2>LACTATE THRESHOLD TEST</h2>
                    <p>Allows athletes to establish and understand their HR threshold numbers. Determine personalized training zones to adapt your training accordingly. Outdoor testing environment to simulate actual training / racing conditions.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Service 2: Sweat Test -->
            <div class="service-card reverse">
                <div class="service-content">
                    <h2>SWEAT TEST<br><span class="subtitle">SODIUM LOSS<br>SWEAT RATE</span></h2>
                    <p>Measuring sweat rate, Sodium & Potassium loss allows athletes to come up with more robust hydration strategies. The data from this test allow shows the importance of pre-workout hydration. In addition, we also monitor skin temperature throughout the workout.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="service-image">
                    <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1476480862126-209bfaa8edc8?w=800" alt="Sweat Testing">
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Service 3: Recovery -->
            <div class="service-card">
                <div class="service-image">
                    <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1541534741688-6078c6bfb5c5?w=800" alt="Recovery Importance">
                </div>
                <div class="service-content">
                    <h2>IMPORTANCE OF RECOVERY</h2>
                    <p>Sleep, a healthy diet and supplementation play a key role in an athlete's recovery. Without the right recovery, your body will not be able to absorb the training. Find out more about how you can maximize recovery through sleep and explore our range of supplements.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Service 4: Personalized Coaching -->
            <div class="service-card reverse">
                <div class="service-content">
                    <h2>PERSONALIZED COACHING</h2>
                    <p>We interpret your DNA and blood work in order to determine the best training plan that suits your individual potential in conjunction with the race distance / time you are looking to achieve. High level personalized coaching will not only help you reach your goals but also allow you to do what you love for longer!</p>
                </div>
                <div class="service-image">
                    <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1517838277536-f5f99be501cd?w=800" alt="Personalized Coaching">
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

