    <!-- Team Section -->
    <section id="team" class="team">
        <div class="container">
            <h2 class="section-title">MEET THE TEAM</h2>
            <p class="team-intro">Miami Endurance Testing was founded by a group of experienced endurance athletes and medical professionals, who shared a passion for helping athletes maximize their potential through personalized testing and training plans.</p>
            
            <div class="team-grid">
                <!-- Jasmel -->
                <div class="team-member">
                    <div class="member-image">
                        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1571019614242-c5c5dee9f50b?w=600" alt="Jasmel">
                    </div>
                    <div class="member-content">
                        <h3>JASMEL</h3>
                        <p>An exceptional triathlete with a remarkable background in martial arts and biology with passion for pushing physical and mental limits. With two martial arts black belts and a track record of representing both the USA and Venezuela in prestigious tournaments, Jasmel brings a unique blend of discipline, focus, and competitive spirit to the world of triathlons. Combined with a deep understanding of biology, Jasmel leverages scientific knowledge to optimize performance and excel in every race.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Scott -->
                <div class="team-member reverse">
                    <div class="member-content">
                        <h3>SCOTT</h3>
                        <p>Meet Scott, a passionate endurance athlete and marketing specialist based in Miami. Originally from Switzerland, Scott's love for endurance sports led him to merge his athletic pursuits with a passion for content creation. Currently chasing big goals over the marathon and 70.3 distances, Scott focuses on high training volume with a scientific approach, the same way he helps athletes optimize their performance. Follow his journey on <a href="https://www.instagram.com/scott_craw/" target="_blank">Instagram</a> & <a href="https://www.youtube.com/@mantraendurance" target="_blank">YouTube</a> for inspiring stories and expert insights in the world of endurance sports.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="member-image">
                        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1552374196-1ab2a1c593e8?w=600" alt="Scott">
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

