                        <div class="testimonial-info">
                            <h4>Michael R.</h4>
                            <span class="athlete-type">Marathon Runner</span>
                            <span class="achievement">BQ Achiever</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <p class="testimonial-quote">After my lactate test, I discovered I was training too hard in Zone 3. Following the Norwegian method with 80% easy runs, I dropped my marathon time from 3:45 to 3:08 and finally qualified for Boston!</p>
                    <div class="testimonial-results">
                        <h5>Performance Improvements</h5>
                        <div class="results-row">
