                    </span>
                </div>

                <!-- Testimonial 2 -->
                <div class="testimonial-card">
                    <div class="testimonial-header">
                        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1438761681033-6461ffad8d80?w=400" alt="Triathlete" class="testimonial-avatar">
                        <div class="testimonial-info">
                            <h4>Sarah K.</h4>
                            <span class="athlete-type">Ironman Triathlete</span>
                            <span class="achievement">Age Group Podium</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <p class="testimonial-quote">The sweat test was a game-changer. I learned I lose 1,200mg of sodium per hour - way more than average! With my custom hydration plan, I stopped cramping on long rides and finally podiumed at my A-race.</p>
                    <div class="testimonial-results">
