                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <p class="testimonial-quote">I was overtraining for years. The lactate test showed my LT2 was much lower than I thought - I was doing "easy" rides way too hard! With personalized zones and double threshold sessions, my FTP jumped from 240W to 305W in 4 months.</p>
