                                        <li><i class="fas fa-check"></i> VO2max estimate</li>
                                        <li><i class="fas fa-check"></i> Personalized training recommendations</li>
                                        <li><i class="fas fa-check"></i> PDF report with all data</li>
                                        <li><i class="fas fa-check"></i> 30-minute consultation</li>
                                    </ul>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    
                    <div class="faq-item">
                        <button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false">
                            <span>How does the sweat test work and why is it important?</span>
                            <i class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i>
                        </button>
                        <div class="faq-answer">
                            <div class="sweat-test-info">
                                <p>Sweat testing measures your individual sweat rate and electrolyte loss to create personalized hydration strategies. <strong>One-size-fits-all hydration plans fail because every athlete loses sodium at different rates!</strong></p>
                                
                                <div class="sweat-diagram">
                                    <svg viewBox="0 0 700 300" class="zone-diagram">
                                        <rect x="0" y="0" width="700" height="300" fill="#f8f9fa" rx="10"/>
                                        
                                        <!-- Title -->
                                        <text x="350" y="25" text-anchor="middle" font-size="16" font-weight="bold" fill="#004e89">Personalized Hydration Strategy</text>
                                        
                                        <!-- Before Test -->
                                        <rect x="50" y="50" width="280" height="230" fill="#fff" stroke="#ddd" stroke-width="2" rx="10"/>
                                        <text x="190" y="75" text-anchor="middle" font-size="14" font-weight="bold" fill="#e74c3c">❌ GUESSWORK</text>
                                        <text x="190" y="100" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11" fill="#666">• Drink when thirsty</text>
                                        <text x="190" y="120" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11" fill="#666">• Generic sports drink</text>
                                        <text x="190" y="140" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11" fill="#666">• 1 bottle per hour?</text>
                                        <text x="190" y="160" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11" fill="#666">• Risk: Dehydration OR</text>
                                        <text x="190" y="180" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11" fill="#666">  hyponatremia</text>
                                        <text x="190" y="210" text-anchor="middle" font-size="10" fill="#e74c3c">Result: Bonk, cramps,</text>
                                        <text x="190" y="225" text-anchor="middle" font-size="10" fill="#e74c3c">or GI distress</text>
                                        
                                        <!-- Arrow -->
                                        <path d="M 350 165 L 370 165" stroke="#ff6b35" stroke-width="3" marker-end="url(#arrow2)"/>
                                        <defs>
                                            <marker id="arrow2" markerWidth="10" markerHeight="7" refX="9" refY="3.5" orient="auto">
                                                <polygon points="0 0, 10 3.5, 0 7" fill="#ff6b35"/>
                                            </marker>
                                        </defs>
                                        
                                        <!-- After Test -->
                                        <rect x="370" y="50" width="280" height="230" fill="#e8f6f3" stroke="#2ecc71" stroke-width="2" rx="10"/>
                                        <text x="510" y="75" text-anchor="middle" font-size="14" font-weight="bold" fill="#2ecc71">✓ SCIENTIFIC</text>
                                        <text x="510" y="100" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11" fill="#333">• Sweat rate: 1.2L/hr</text>
                                        <text x="510" y="120" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11" fill="#333">• Sodium loss: 920mg/L</text>
                                        <text x="510" y="140" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11" fill="#333">• Pre-load: 500ml + salt</text>
                                        <text x="510" y="160" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11" fill="#333">• During: 200ml/15min</text>
                                        <text x="510" y="180" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11" fill="#333">• Custom electrolyte mix</text>
                                        <text x="510" y="210" text-anchor="middle" font-size="10" fill="#2ecc71">Result: Optimal performance,</text>
                                        <text x="510" y="225" text-anchor="middle" font-size="10" fill="#2ecc71">no cramps, sustained power</text>
                                    </svg>
                                </div>
                                
                                <div class="sweat-metrics">
                                    <h5>What We Measure:</h5>
                                    <div class="metrics-grid">
                                        <div class="metric">
                                            <span class="metric-icon">💧</span>
                                            <h6>Sweat Rate</h6>
                                            <p>Liters lost per hour at race intensity (0.5L to 3L+ range)</p>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="metric">
                                            <span class="metric-icon">🧂</span>
                                            <h6>Sodium Concentration</h6>
                                            <p>mg per liter of sweat (200mg to 2000mg+ - huge variation!)</p>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="metric">
                                            <span class="metric-icon">⚡</span>
                                            <h6>Potassium Levels</h6>
                                            <p>Important for muscle function and cramp prevention</p>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="metric">
                                            <span class="metric-icon">🌡️</span>
                                            <h6>Skin Temperature</h6>
                                            <p>Thermoregulation efficiency and heat adaptation</p>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                
                                <div class="hydration-strategy">
                                    <h5><i class="fas fa-flask"></i> Your Personalized Strategy Includes:</h5>
                                    <ul>
                                        <li><strong>Pre-Exercise:</strong> Exact fluid and sodium pre-loading protocol</li>
                                        <li><strong>During Exercise:</strong> Hourly fluid and electrolyte targets based on your sweat rate</li>
                                        <li><strong>Post-Exercise:</strong> Rehydration calculations for rapid recovery</li>
                                        <li><strong>Environmental Adjustments:</strong> Hot weather vs. cool weather modifications</li>
                                        <li><strong>Race Day Plan:</strong> Specific aid station timing and product recommendations</li>
                                    </ul>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    
                    <div class="faq-item">
                        <button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false">
