                                <div class="coaching-software">
                                    <h5><i class="fas fa-laptop"></i> Tools & Technology:</h5>
                                    <p>We use TrainingPeaks, Strava, and 80/20 Endurance methodology to deliver elite-level coaching. Your training plan syncs to your devices (Garmin, Wahoo, etc.) with specific targets for every interval.</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
