                            <i class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i>
                        </button>
                        <div class="faq-answer">
                            <p>We understand training and life can be unpredictable:</p>
                            <ul>
                                <li><strong>24+ hours notice:</strong> Free rescheduling or full refund</li>
                                <li><strong>Same-day cancellation:</strong> 50% refund (we can often fill the slot)</li>
                                <li><strong>No-show:</strong> No refund, but credit toward future test</li>
                                <li><strong>Weather-related:</strong> Full refund or reschedule for outdoor tests</li>
                                <li><strong>Illness:</strong> Reschedule anytime with doctor's note - no penalty</li>
                            </ul>
                            <p>We want you at your best for testing - tired or sick athletes produce unreliable data. If you're not feeling ready, let's reschedule!</p>
                        </div>
